[00:01.60]Chinese Speech Contest December 24,
[00:05.12]2022 
[00:10.12]To enhance international students’ ability to speak Chinese 
[00:15.12]and enrich after-class activities for them,
[00:18.39]the Student Union of Department of Chinese Language and Literature is organizing a school-wide 
[00:24.39]Chinese speech contest for international students,
[00:30.21]which is to be held on Saturday next week (December 31) at the auditorium.
[00:34.14]Those who are interested in taking part in it may sign up 
[00:39.14]with the monitor of their classes before Tuesday next week.
[00:43.04]Five prestigious professors from Peking University 
[00:47.04]and Tsinghua University will be invited to be the honorable judges.
[00:51.63]The first six winners will be given awards.
[00:55.72]If the would-be candidates have any questions,
[01:00.26]please do not hesitate to contact us at the following address: studentunion@163.com.
[01:08.55]Everybody is welcome to be present at the contest.
[01:11.80]The Student Union of Department of Chinese language and Literature.
